            <ArticleTitle>Prescribing exercise to help your patients lose weight.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>141-50</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.3949/ccjm.83a.14139</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Exercise, in conjunction with diet, is critical to losing weight and maintaining health in obese patients. While it can be challenging for an obese person to transition to a healthy lifestyle, the physical and emotional benefits of a regular exercise program make it worth the effort.</AbstractText>
